# Halt on a bespoke type converter

Do not invent a converter type. The object converter is `MetaDataRowTypeConverter`, the same type C# and TypeScript already name. Cell rewrites stay on the catalog converters bound from `Schema.types()`.

If the change seems to need a new converter (`FacetRowConverter`, `IdentityRowConverter`, or any other name), stop and say so. A second type that does the same job is not a substitute.
